== Trivia ==
* The '''Dead Man's Hunt''' was added by {{RN|YT|Dra2oon}} as part of the [[Minister Election]]s.
** He had no design impact on the hunt.
* The '''Dead Man's Journal''' may be related to [[Divan (disambiguation)|Divan]].
**'''Divan''' is the first king of Dwarves, and the one who discovered [[Crystal Hollows]], {{Item|Divan Fragment}}, and {{Item|Divan's Alloy}}. His status is currently unknown, though most likely deceased.

